      "ruku": 104,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 819,
      "text": "If you could only see when they are made to stand before their Lord. He will say, “Is this not the truth?” They will say, “Yes indeed, by our Lord.” He will say, “So taste the punishment for your disbelief.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 131,
      "ruku": 104,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 820,
      "text": "Losers indeed are those who deny the meeting with Allah, until when the Hour comes upon them by surprise, they will say, “Woe to us for having ignored this!” They will bear their burdens on their backs. Terrible indeed is their burden!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 131,
      "ruku": 105,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 821,
      "text": "The life of this world is nothing but play and amusement, but the Home of the Hereafter is far better for those who fear Allah. Do you not then understand?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 131,
      "ruku": 105,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 822,
      "text": "We know well that what they say grieves you [O Prophet]. It is not you that they doubt, rather it is the verses of Allah that the wrongdoers deny.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
