      "ruku": 105,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 824,
      "text": "If you find their denial hard to bear, then seek – if you can – a tunnel into the earth or a stairway into the sky to bring them a sign. If Allah had willed, He could have brought them all to guidance; so do not be of those who are ignorant.",
